&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="variables-that-cannot-be-shared"&gt;Variables that cannot be shared&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="variables-that-cannot-be-shared"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#variables-that-cannot-be-shared" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;A notebook variable becomes a package-level variable of the generated program,
which needs its type to be written there. A variable whose type cannot be
written outside its package (an unexported type) cannot be shared: the error
says so and suggests a private name (&lt;code&gt;_x&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>